<title>UK: LIFFE coffee ends at lows, cocoa off lows.</title>
<headline>LIFFE coffee ends at lows, cocoa off lows.</headline>
<text>
<p>COFFEE -  Ends at day's lows as NY slips from early uptrend. Sept off $40 at $1,735.</p>
<p>COCOA - Off lows after sterling eases from highs. Sept down seven stg at 1,033 stg.</p>
<p>SUGAR - Mostly firmer, with focus on Aug, Oct. August $4.20 higher at $326.20 at 1603 GMT.</p>
</text>
